WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.590
OVA Adapts Chapter 55 to 59, Barato arc. After credits there's also Chapter 32: Attack of the Mysterious Winged Terror.

00:00:00.590 --> 00:00:04.480
Barato

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.990
Screaming like that proves that you weren't prepared.

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:19.530
Listen up, you damn kids.

00:00:20.070 --> 00:00:22.370
In times like these, any man who makes it to old age...

00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:25.170
...is a survivor.

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:31.280
Good grief...

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:34.100
A while back in this post office town,

00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:36.760
a gang boss called Hidaro had control.

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:41.590
But one of their henchmen split and started their own gang.

00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:43.970
They've been killing each other every day since.

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:46.440
You're a bodyguard too, aren't you?

00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:48.200
I can tell by your face.

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:49.780
So which side are you gonna work for?

00:00:50.210 --> 00:00:51.710
Dunno...

00:00:51.710 --> 00:00:56.410
Anyway, have you seen a man with strange tattoos around here?

00:00:56.410 --> 00:00:57.570
Tattoos?

00:00:58.020 --> 00:00:59.780
You looking for any specific pattern?

00:01:00.440 --> 00:01:02.380
I guess not...

00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:15.700
The Barato Bodyguards

00:01:12.370 --> 00:01:15.920
A bowl of Ochazuke with chopped takuan on top.

00:01:16.560 --> 00:01:19.470
You sure love it that way, huh?

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:26.360
You're the ones who killed my men?

00:01:26.360 --> 00:01:27.980
It's obviously bullshit, pops!

00:01:28.290 --> 00:01:31.020
Who the hell are even these senile old men?

00:01:31.450 --> 00:01:33.980
I want you to kidnap Hidoro's mistress.

00:01:33.980 --> 00:01:39.910
If you manage to take her and her unborn child hostage, I'll hire you for 50 yen.

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:46.190
I wonder which one of Hidoro and Umakichi is the source of the rumours...

00:01:46.190 --> 00:01:47.550
I wouldn't know...

00:01:48.270 --> 00:01:54.150
The Matsumae domain only gave the world two good things. Matsumaezuke and you, my friend.

00:01:55.170 --> 00:01:57.590
Pardon me, swordsmen!

00:01:58.040 --> 00:01:59.450
I've got 60 yen here.

00:01:59.450 --> 00:02:01.700
Join us on the Hidoro side.

00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:06.090
You gentlemen are different from my cowardly son and his hoodlums.

00:02:06.090 --> 00:02:07.850
I can tell by just looking at you.

00:02:08.260 --> 00:02:10.340
Sorry to bother you during your meal.

00:02:10.680 --> 00:02:13.770
Shinpei! Bring our guests back when they're ready!

00:02:15.640 --> 00:02:19.050
Your mother is the actual boss of the Hidoro gang, isn't she?

00:02:19.860 --> 00:02:23.240
Judging by her personality, I doubt a mistress would be a good hostage.

00:02:23.940 --> 00:02:25.400
Kidnap the mistress!?

00:02:25.400 --> 00:02:27.530
Umakichi said that was the plan.

00:02:27.530 --> 00:02:32.840
Those bastards! I bet they're going to hold her hostage until we hand it over...

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:35.260
Hand what over?

00:02:35.710 --> 00:02:41.590
This one guy gambled away all his money and couldn't pay up, so he offered something weird as collateral.

00:02:42.130 --> 00:02:46.150
He said it was the skin of a prisoner who broke out of Abashiri Prison.

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:50.870
And the tattoo on that skin would lead us to a stash of hidden Ainu gold.

00:02:53.660 --> 00:02:54.860
Ooh?

00:02:55.120 --> 00:03:01.340
So the police chief wants to let Umakichi take over all the gambling in town and claim all the bribes for himself?

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:03.080
Yeah, but that's not all...

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:06.770
Apparantly he's also after something the Hidoro gang is hiding.

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:13.540
They say some skilled samurai has come to town. Where are they?

00:03:13.770 --> 00:03:15.560
Well if it isn't the Chief!

00:03:15.560 --> 00:03:18.400
I don't happen to know anything of the sort!

00:03:18.400 --> 00:03:21.560
Looks like this thug is new in town, too.

00:03:21.560 --> 00:03:24.980
Since you're new here in my town, I'll give you a piece of advice.

00:03:24.980 --> 00:03:27.120
Join the Umakichi gang.

00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:31.900
If I find out you're working as one of Hidoro's bodyguards, you'll regret it.

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:42.200
He's Hokuchin Unit!?

00:03:42.350 --> 00:03:45.310
I've got a question for you, Chief Ass Chin.

00:04:07.490 --> 00:04:09.760
He hit the bell at this range!?

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:12.680
What unbelievable skill!

00:04:14.440 --> 00:04:15.710
Right this way, sir!

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:25.120
That bell he just rang...

00:04:25.120 --> 00:04:28.090
It's the signal that something serious is about to begin.

00:04:28.730 --> 00:04:33.080
Mr Samurai, you gotta help us hide the mistress!

00:04:33.640 --> 00:04:35.840
The kid she's pregnant with...

00:04:35.840 --> 00:04:37.040
Is actually mine!

00:04:37.410 --> 00:04:39.520
Mom wants to keep that skin hidden,

00:04:39.520 --> 00:04:42.340
so she wouldn't give a second thought about her!

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:47.230
Shinpei, what's the matter?

00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:50.750
Chieko! Cover your face and come with us!

00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:11.000
Why the hell did you kill them!?

00:05:11.380 --> 00:05:15.660
Bring your mother here and tell her that Umakichi's men did this.

00:05:16.090 --> 00:05:21.250
She may be an evil woman, but I find evil people are the weakest when it comes to blood ties.

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:24.880
Make her bring that tattooed skin from wherever she hid it.

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:31.470
You and your family should stick to the world of small town brawls and gambling.

00:05:31.970 --> 00:05:35.120
You'll be satisfied if I destroy the Umakichi gang, right?

00:05:35.460 --> 00:05:37.590
For my reward,

00:05:37.590 --> 00:05:39.390
I want that tattooed skin.

00:05:43.250 --> 00:05:45.280
Umakichi's guys did this.

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:47.110
They left a note.

00:05:47.250 --> 00:05:52.000
It says that they're holding Chieko hostage and they want to exchange her for the tattooed skin.

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:55.200
I'll never hand it over!

00:05:55.820 --> 00:05:58.260
The baby in Chieko's belly...

00:05:58.840 --> 00:06:00.420
Is your grandchild!

00:06:06.210 --> 00:06:11.560
How about I cut that cleft chin so wide that you'll turn into a full body ass crack?

00:06:11.560 --> 00:06:13.560
I don't know what you're talking about!

00:06:13.890 --> 00:06:18.170
You'd better tell me everything you know about the tattooed skin right now, Chief.

00:06:18.170 --> 00:06:23.960
The Hidoro family probably has that skin hidden in a secret room somewhere in their lodge!

00:06:23.960 --> 00:06:29.440
My plan was to kidnap Hidoro's mistress and hold her hostage until they gave up the skin...

00:06:30.120 --> 00:06:32.560
Show me where the mistress lives.

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:38.410
What on earth happened here?

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:39.920
A falling out or something?

00:06:39.920 --> 00:06:43.850
No that's not it. Somebody already kidnapped her!

00:06:43.850 --> 00:06:49.300
I've got to do something! Hidoro is going to think that my gang did this and launch an attack!

00:06:49.820 --> 00:06:53.480
<i>A .44-40 Winchester cartridge.</i>

00:06:53.900 --> 00:06:55.720
<i>That old man used one of those...</i>

00:06:56.890 --> 00:06:58.050
Umakichi!

00:07:00.220 --> 00:07:04.050
I'm a coward. I've always been afraid of any kind of violence.

00:07:04.050 --> 00:07:07.560
When you get your hands on that skin, please just get out of here.

00:07:07.770 --> 00:07:12.060
Chieko and I will pack up and leave this town.

00:07:12.450 --> 00:07:15.990
We'll find someplace else to live, free from my parents.

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:19.690
We don't think you're a coward at all.

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:23.590
Anyway, I'll leave the rest up to you guys!

00:07:25.330 --> 00:07:30.170
What's there to discuss!? Let's get Chieko back already!

00:07:30.450 --> 00:07:33.180
This is the perfect chance to settle things for good.

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:34.060
What?

00:07:36.360 --> 00:07:39.720
All right, back to work, my bodyguards!

00:07:39.820 --> 00:07:42.350
All of you, get ready for battle!

00:07:43.140 --> 00:07:46.590
Oooh! Get ready, boys!

00:07:46.590 --> 00:07:49.480
You guys sure are slow to get fighting.

00:07:49.480 --> 00:07:50.110
Huh?

00:07:50.470 --> 00:07:53.950
I guess I should go get the tattooed skin.

00:07:56.180 --> 00:07:57.740
Give me a break!

00:07:58.110 --> 00:08:01.940
Why do I have to do the exchange, too?

00:08:01.940 --> 00:08:04.580
We can take blame for it when it's all over.

00:08:04.850 --> 00:08:08.530
We'd better hurry. Hidoro and his men will be here soon.

00:08:08.530 --> 00:08:10.550
Why would you tell them to come here!?

00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:20.000
Mom, you're really going to hand over the skin, right?

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:21.960
If you try to pull any tricks, they might kill—

00:08:21.960 --> 00:08:24.270
Shut up, boy! I know what I'm doing.

00:08:24.570 --> 00:08:29.260
Once you've got the woman, get her out of here right away.

00:08:29.260 --> 00:08:33.280
When I take the first shot, that'll be the signal for our bodyguards to start the attack.

00:08:33.630 --> 00:08:36.440
I'm sure Umakichi's men are waiting in ambush nearby.

00:08:36.760 --> 00:08:39.380
If you hesitate, you'll get caught in the crossfire!

00:08:40.380 --> 00:08:44.160
Hidoro's men are assembling!

00:08:44.160 --> 00:08:46.500
All right, let's go!

00:08:50.750 --> 00:08:51.930
Chieko!

00:08:51.930 --> 00:08:54.620
Hurry up and hand over the damn hostage!

00:08:54.620 --> 00:08:58.130
You know I can't do that! Show the skin first!

00:08:58.300 --> 00:09:01.100
Mom, just give them the skin!

00:09:04.890 --> 00:09:06.130
Go on and check it, then.

00:09:10.720 --> 00:09:12.950
<i>I won't let mom give the signal.</i>

00:09:14.160 --> 00:09:16.290
<i>It's time for the killing to end.</i>

00:09:17.020 --> 00:09:19.330
<i>Everything is finally going to work out.</i>

00:09:26.690 --> 00:09:28.200
They shot the old man!

00:09:30.550 --> 00:09:31.960
Why bother with the lipstick!?

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:37.060
I <i>knew</i> it was one of the old geezers.

00:09:37.060 --> 00:09:39.010
Looks like they saw through everything.

00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:40.600
What are you doing!?

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:42.940
Stay away! You'll get shot!

00:09:46.090 --> 00:09:47.210
Pops!

00:09:48.700 --> 00:09:49.850
It's all gone wrong!

00:09:50.130 --> 00:09:52.320
How did it end up like this?

00:09:52.470 --> 00:09:56.480
Umakichi! The skin is right in front of the barbershop! Go get it!

00:09:59.720 --> 00:10:02.740
That gunshot was the signal to attack, right?

00:10:02.740 --> 00:10:03.840
You sure?

00:10:03.840 --> 00:10:05.270
I... I'm out of here.

00:10:05.270 --> 00:10:06.790
Wha? Hold up!

00:10:11.260 --> 00:10:13.770
We're pushing forward to the barbershop!

00:10:14.180 --> 00:10:16.820
I'll cut down any man who tries to retreat!

00:10:21.090 --> 00:10:24.010
Golden Kamuy

00:10:24.010 --> 00:10:25.970
Go! Go! It's right in front of the barbershop!

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:31.810
Umakichi's gang is here! Shoot them!

00:10:32.920 --> 00:10:36.280
These yakuza can't fight for shit.

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:37.030
Hey!

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:39.430
You idiots on the frontlines!

00:10:39.430 --> 00:10:41.320
Don't run down the street at an angle!

00:10:41.320 --> 00:10:45.340
It exposes you for too long! Run straight across from cover to cover!

00:10:45.340 --> 00:10:46.000
Yessir!

00:10:48.460 --> 00:10:50.580
Keep your head behind cover!

00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:53.420
The man in the tower is our main problem, but our guns can't reach.

00:10:53.660 --> 00:10:56.600
We need to get as close as we can, then open fire all at once.

00:10:56.600 --> 00:11:00.320
How do we even get close? He'll shoot us if we step out of cover!

00:11:03.350 --> 00:11:04.640
Who the hell are you guys!?

00:11:04.860 --> 00:11:07.630
We'll pass through the houses!

00:11:07.630 --> 00:11:09.800
Tell the rest of the men!

00:11:09.800 --> 00:11:10.760
Yessir!

00:11:10.760 --> 00:11:12.520
Get out!

00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:16.980
Whoops.

00:11:19.330 --> 00:11:21.740
Someone go get the damn skin!

00:11:24.110 --> 00:11:27.000
Yes! It's finally mine!

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:34.660
Drive back the enemy and keep pushing forward!

00:11:34.660 --> 00:11:37.960
Once we get close, we can take out that sniper!

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:42.800
Split into three groups and keep your distance from each other! That'll make us harder to target!

00:11:43.130 --> 00:11:45.510
We'll close in on the tower from multiple sides!

00:11:50.540 --> 00:11:52.140
Cover me.
-What?

00:11:52.550 --> 00:11:54.740
It doesn't matter if you hit anybody or not.

00:11:54.740 --> 00:11:58.150
Just keep shooting at the enemy
to force them on the defensive.

00:11:58.580 --> 00:12:02.440
You move parts of your forces whilst the enemy is pinned down.

00:12:02.440 --> 00:12:07.040
Once those forces are in position, they lay down cover fire so the rest of the forces can move.

00:12:07.040 --> 00:12:10.080
Then you just repeat the process.

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:11.260
Fire!

00:12:30.910 --> 00:12:32.230
Incredible...

00:12:34.990 --> 00:12:36.300
That's strange...

00:12:38.290 --> 00:12:43.480
All the rumors about Mrs. Hidoro say that she's extremely greedy, but she doesn't seem to care about that skin.

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:47.750
Shoot him down!

00:12:47.840 --> 00:12:49.730
Shit! When did he...

00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:54.180
They're over there too? They're encircling me, huh?

00:12:54.910 --> 00:12:56.750
Seems like I waited too long to retreat.

00:13:01.940 --> 00:13:03.080
We got him!

00:13:03.330 --> 00:13:05.250
We took down the guy in the watchtower!

00:13:09.860 --> 00:13:11.230
Get your hands off that!

00:13:11.840 --> 00:13:14.220
That thing belongs to me.

00:13:14.940 --> 00:13:18.000
You're challenging me, then?

00:13:19.390 --> 00:13:22.870
Once the fire starts burning within me,

00:13:23.190 --> 00:13:27.500
only your blood will be able to put it out.

00:14:02.250 --> 00:14:04.600
Umakichi's men are running away.

00:14:05.770 --> 00:14:07.580
The battle is finally over.

00:14:07.990 --> 00:14:08.990
Hey, look...

00:14:09.860 --> 00:14:10.850
There's a fire!

00:14:11.220 --> 00:14:13.720
Isn't our herring lodge over there?
-What!?

00:14:14.930 --> 00:14:16.160
Mom!

00:14:18.820 --> 00:14:21.770
Looks like she put out a fake after all.

00:14:21.770 --> 00:14:25.040
She truly is a monstrous woman.

00:14:34.810 --> 00:14:37.240
Grab as many valuables as you can!

00:14:37.240 --> 00:14:38.810
I'll get the tattooed skin!

00:14:39.590 --> 00:14:41.660
That was a fake!?

00:14:41.660 --> 00:14:45.270
You'd trade your grandchild's life for a damn tattoo!?

00:14:45.270 --> 00:14:46.110
Hey!

00:14:46.490 --> 00:14:48.320
What did you just say?

00:14:48.320 --> 00:14:49.950
"Grandchild"?

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:54.860
Chieko isn't pregnant with your kid! She's pregnant with Shinpei's!

00:14:55.210 --> 00:14:58.870
I checked your sperm in secret long ago.

00:14:58.990 --> 00:15:01.450
You're infertile! You can't have children!

00:15:10.990 --> 00:15:12.800
Mom! Where'd you go?

00:15:20.760 --> 00:15:22.290
Is that the real...

00:15:23.530 --> 00:15:26.640
Mom... Just get rid of that damn thing!

00:15:26.900 --> 00:15:30.000
You're just like your real father.

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:31.730
Not an ounce of ambition.

00:15:31.940 --> 00:15:36.370
I bet your real father is still walking around some fishery with a basket full of herring on his back.

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:45.780
Dad...

00:15:46.620 --> 00:15:48.190
Please, that's enough!

00:15:50.580 --> 00:15:53.760
Who're you calling dad, you piece of shit?

00:15:54.480 --> 00:15:57.420
You've been deceiving me all this time...

00:15:57.850 --> 00:16:04.180
How about I split your head open with this rake, mix you into the fish meal and ship you out?

00:16:05.500 --> 00:16:08.940
Now I understand why you were always so damn useless!

00:16:08.940 --> 00:16:12.480
Knowing that you're no son of mine is a huge relief!

00:16:12.480 --> 00:16:17.910
Shut up! Just you watch, I'll build a new life without help from any of you!

00:16:18.240 --> 00:16:23.330
I'll make a mansion ten times bigger than this pathetic little lodge!

00:16:23.530 --> 00:16:25.850
And if you're ever low on money,

00:16:25.850 --> 00:16:28.500
I'll let you work as a mokko carrier!

00:16:39.940 --> 00:16:44.700
Killing your parents is like a rite of passage before you truly can become independent.

00:16:45.630 --> 00:16:50.070
And sniveling weaklings like yourself piss me off more than anything.

00:17:09.100 --> 00:17:12.100
Shinpei, the lodge is burning down...

00:17:13.290 --> 00:17:15.180
That's for the best.

00:17:15.610 --> 00:17:17.670
Let's go, Chieko.

00:17:18.790 --> 00:17:19.860
See you!

00:17:27.570 --> 00:17:29.150
That wasn't so hard.

00:17:29.370 --> 00:17:32.140
Heh, you're a real piece of work.

00:17:32.140 --> 00:17:35.860
Seems like a crazy guy like you was needed to get it.

00:17:36.650 --> 00:17:38.480
What are you after?

00:17:38.480 --> 00:17:43.450
I only came here by chance after hearing some rumors.

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:46.200
But then I saw you in front of the barbershop...

00:17:46.200 --> 00:17:51.860
I used to work under an excellent intelligence officer, so I knew who you were right away.

00:17:53.230 --> 00:17:56.170
How would you like to hire a skilled bodyguard?

00:17:56.860 --> 00:17:59.140
Mister Hijikata Toshizou...

00:19:32.850 --> 00:19:37.360
Attack of the Mysterious Winged Terror!

00:19:56.100 --> 00:19:57.010
It's here!

00:19:57.010 --> 00:19:58.160
It's huge!

00:20:06.350 --> 00:20:10.850
When it lands on the log, we use this hook called a Karacirap to catch it.

00:20:15.210 --> 00:20:22.100
But even the biggest hook is no match for that terrifying monster, Huri...

00:20:23.630 --> 00:20:27.960
A single one of it's wings is said to be 7 ri long.

00:20:27.960 --> 00:20:34.180
When Huri appears, it's said that the sun is blocked out and women and children are snatched away.

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:45.300
I got it!

00:20:48.920 --> 00:20:50.720
Asiripa, wake up!

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:52.060
What the hell do I do now?

00:20:53.080 --> 00:20:53.770
Huh?

00:20:53.770 --> 00:20:55.230
Don't "huh" me!

00:20:55.230 --> 00:20:56.590
Shiraishi! Get your ass out here!

00:20:56.590 --> 00:20:57.950
Hurry up and pin it down!

00:21:00.700 --> 00:21:01.990
Ow ow ow ow!

00:21:02.430 --> 00:21:03.410
That hurt.

00:21:03.410 --> 00:21:04.290
Go back to sleep!

00:21:04.820 --> 00:21:06.720
Gotcha!

00:21:07.860 --> 00:21:09.270
Great work.

00:21:14.860 --> 00:21:17.020
What the hell is that huge bird!?

00:21:17.410 --> 00:21:18.700
Asiripa is...

00:21:19.240 --> 00:21:21.020
Floating!

00:21:23.180 --> 00:21:24.470
Hey!

00:21:24.470 --> 00:21:26.610
Let go! Let go, you stupid bird!

00:21:36.080 --> 00:21:37.700
<i>During the end of the Meiji Era...</i>

00:21:37.700 --> 00:21:41.310
<i>A giant bird attacked a carriage in a field in the Kushiro region.</i>

00:21:41.310 --> 00:21:44.980
<i>The local farmers ended up beating it to death with sticks.</i>

00:21:44.980 --> 00:21:49.670
<i>That giant bird is said to have migrated from the Asian mainland.</i>

00:21:49.670 --> 00:21:52.110
<i>Some say you can still see it on a sunny day.</i>

00:21:52.950 --> 00:21:54.790
The legendary giant bird...

00:21:54.790 --> 00:21:56.570
